    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "E7EEF1AC2C216F2B",
      "text": "……你想和我说什么？[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "5C185D40FEE607D5",
      "text": "你和其他手下相比，\\n在对待老大的方式上有所不同。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "5C185C40FEE60622",
      "text": "能告诉我这是为什么吗？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "E7EEF6AC2C2177AA",
      "text": "你的眼力真好。\\n……好吧，我告诉你。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "E7EEF7AC2C21795D",
      "text": "我以前很讨厌枇琶。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "5C14DF40FEE2FBE4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "E7EEF4AC2C217444",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "E7EEF5AC2C2175F7",
      "text": "她不但是个美女，运动全能，\\n而且还是个优秀的训练家。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "E7EEEAAC2C216346",
      "text": "枇琶在入学后立刻就成了\\n学院内的红人。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "E7EEEBAC2C2164F9",
      "text": "而且她的人气超过了\\n在那之前最受欢迎的我……[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "5C14E040FEE2FD97",
      "text": "所以，你开始向她找茬儿……？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "E7F278AC2C248A67",
      "text": "嗯，我号召同学们\\n干了各种各样的事……\\r\\n我当时真是太蠢了。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_11",
      "hash64": "E7F277AC2C2488B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "5C14E140FEE2FF4A",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_12",
      "hash64": "E7F27AAC2C248DCD",
      "text": "不过，这毕竟是小孩子的游戏啊。\\n玩腻了就会想要寻找下一波刺激。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_13",
      "hash64": "E7F279AC2C248C1A",
      "text": "于是班里下一个霸凌的对象\\n很快就变成了我。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "5C14E240FEE300FD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_14",
      "hash64": "E7F274AC2C24839B",
      "text": "……这是因果报应啊。\\n但是，枇琶却向如此愚蠢的我\\r\\n伸出了援手。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_15",
      "hash64": "E7F273AC2C2481E8",
      "text": "她说：“没有容身之地会很痛苦吧？”\\n于是邀请了我加入天星队。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "5C14DB40FEE2F518",
      "text": "邀请霸凌自己的罪魁祸首……\\n真是个了不起的女生啊。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_16",
      "hash64": "E7F276AC2C248701",
      "text": "……我真的是那么想的。\\n加入天星队后，我一直都很快乐。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "5C14DC40FEE2F6CB",
      "text": "虽然也有天星队\\n在搞霸凌的传闻……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_17",
      "hash64": "E7F275AC2C24854E",
      "text": "你听过之前那些话之后，\\n还会那么想吗？[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "5C14DD40FEE2F87E",
      "text": "不，这倒不会……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_18",
      "hash64": "E7F270AC2C247CCF",
      "text": "我能有今天，都是托了\\n枇琶和天星队的福。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_19",
      "hash64": "E7F26FAC2C247B1C",
      "text": "他们是我们重要的宝物。\\n……不要夺走他们。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
